==Trivia==
*If the player attempts to lower the crane while it is positioned over the cage, they will receive the message "You're supposed to be putting people in there, not taking them out!"
*There is an inaccessible door in the lower area with an "open" option. This door is the same object as the accessible one that the player uses to talk with [[Molly]] and to leave the event, and it was confirmed to function identically to it.{{CiteReddit|author=Mod Husky|url=https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/comments/1rd75kf/jmods_please_tell_me_what_happens_when_you_open/o762mnm/?context=10|title=JMods, please tell me what happens when you open the inaccessible door in this random event. I have lost sleep over it for the past 19+ years.|quote=So I decided to go try it on a test world out of curiosity and it seems like whoever made the room mapped down the same door in both locations. So it just presents the same Molly dialogue as the door right next to you with the option to leave if you want.|date=2026-02-24|archiveurl=|archivedate=2026-02-25|notes=|name=}}

